      "description": "Never miss a beat of the season.\n\nThe NBA App is your home to follow every game, tap to watch live, catch up with highlights, track the latest scores and stats, and get personalized updates on your favorite teams and players.\n\nNew for the 2026-27 NBA season:\n\n- Tap To Watch. Live games are now easier to find. Just tap the broadcast logo for the game you want to watch to be directed to where it is being shown.* \n- Go deeper into every game. Game Pulse combines live insights, advanced stats, and highlights, so you know what’s happening and why it matters.\n- Put your team front and center. Get faster access to your team’s scores, schedule, standings and latest news.\n- Watch your way. Get personalized multiview recommendations and track games that matter with the new Focus View.\n- Get NBA answers instantly. Ask NBA gives you access to news, team and player stats and decades of league history, just by asking.\n\nThe NBA App is free to download and gives fans access to:\n\n- Live scores, stats, and standings\n- The full season schedule, with where to watch and access to live basketball games with Tap to Watch*\n- The latest basketball news, highlights, game previews and recaps\n- Stories from across the National Basketball Association\n- Live channels streaming news, highlights, studio shows, and more\n- Personalized live updates on your favorite NBA teams and players\n- Live free access to postgame press conferences after every game\n\n*Fans are guided to log in or subscribe to the appropriate streaming service including ABC, ESPN, NBC, Peacock, Amazon Prime Video, and NBA League Pass for out-of-market games\n\nNBA League Pass subscribers have access to:\n\n- The most NBA games, live and on-demand**\n- Stream up to 4 games at once with multiview on select devices \n- In-game stats overlays for deeper game context\n- Additional broadcasts, including Data Mode and NBA Hoopervision\n- Mobile-optimized game streams for phones and tablets\n- Select local-language broadcasts\n- Archive of historical NBA games and moments\n- 24/7 NBA TV coverage featuring live games, original programming, and more\n\nLeague Pass Premium subscribers also get access to:\n\n- Concurrent streaming: stream games on up to 3 devices at once\n- Download games to watch offline\n- In-arena entertainment during game breaks instead of commercials\n\n**Blackouts and restrictions apply in the US and Canada\n\nNBA ID is for every fan. Sign up for perks like:\n\n- Personalized settings shaped by your favorite teams and players\n- Access to free live game nights and exclusive content\n- Upgraded fan experiences \n\nGet the best free NBA coverage, including pre-season games, global games, NBA Emirates NBA Cup, Christmas Day games, NBA All-Star Weekend and All-Star Game, NBA Playoff games, NBA Finals, NBA Draft, NBA Summer League, and NBA 2K League. The official NBA app features highlights of every shot, dunk, and nothing but net from the Atlanta Hawks, Boston Celtics, Brooklyn Nets, Charlotte Hornets, Chicago Bulls, Cleveland Cavaliers, Dallas Mavericks, Denver Nuggets, Detroit Pistons, Golden State Warriors, Houston Rockets, Indiana Pacers, LA Clippers, Los Angeles Lakers, Memphis Grizzlies, Miami Heat, Milwaukee Bucks, Minnesota Timberwolves, New Orleans Pelicans, New York Knicks, Oklahoma City Thunder, Orlando Magic, Philadelphia 76ers, Phoenix Suns, Portland Trail Blazers, Sacramento Kings, San Antonio Spurs, Toronto Raptors, Utah Jazz, and Washington Wizards.\n\nNBA League Pass and NBA TV subscribers can access their subscription by logging into the App.\n\nPurchase NBA League Pass or NBA TV, and you will be automatically billed through Apple every 30 days (monthly packages) or every 365 days (annual packages) until you cancel your subscription. Refunds are not available after subscriptions have been activated.\n\nPlease visit support.watch.nba.com if you are experiencing any issues.\n\nTerms of Use: http://www.nba.com/news/termsofuse\nPrivacy Policy: http://www.nba.com/news/privacy_policy.html",
